  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal term commonly seen in government advisories, immigration documents, and travel warnings. More formal than {海外旅行|かいがいりょこう} (overseas trip) and carries an administrative tone.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {渡航|とこう}{先|さき} (travel destination)\n- {渡航|とこう}{禁止|きんし} (travel ban)\n- {渡航|とこう}{歴|れき} (travel history)\n- {渡航|とこう}{制限|せいげん} (travel restrictions)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {海外旅行|かいがいりょこう}: overseas trip — casual, everyday term for traveling abroad\n- {出国|しゅっこく}: departure from a country — focuses on the act of leaving",
